  "Scripture authority is the 1962 Amharic Bible (UBS; NT revised 2003). Its New Testament is on disk (ebible mirror gracious-tech/fetch_collection, bibles/amh_amh); it carries no Old Testament, so every OT quotation is self_rendered in the 1962 register.",
  "The mirror lumps some verse ranges under one marker (e.g. \"\\v 1-10\") but keeps only the last verse's text, so the earlier verses of such a range are absent; quotations of those verses are self_rendered.",
